{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101131","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101131/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101131/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101131/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101131","id":2768919665,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Gu-Hj","number":101131,"title":"Fix `is_anything_pressed` by using `physical_keys_pressed` to detect if a key is pressed","user":{"login":"pcvonz","id":6378569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzg1Njk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6378569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz","html_url":"https://github.com/pcvonz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-01-04T16:45:23Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T10:35:10Z","closed_at":"2025-01-22T04:25:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101131","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101131","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101131.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101131.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\n~When a modifier key is released (shift, ctl, alt, etc.), keys that use a modifier will now be removed from the pressed keyset map. This fixes an issue with the `is_anything_pressed` method on `Input` ([steps to reproduce here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100879#issuecomment-2566728979)).~\r\n\r\n~Things to consider...~\r\n~- Instead of removing the keys from the set, the key could be modified (e.g. `_` becomes `-`, `I` becomes `i`). This doesn't seem to matter since a new keypress event for `-` or `i` will be generated after shift is released.~\r\n\r\nI found an easier solution: This will now change the `is_anything_pressed` method to use the `physical_keys_pressed` set instead of `keys_pressed` because `keys_pressed` will have stale keys if you press a modifier and then release the modified key, which causes `is_anything_pressed` to always return true. Physical keys pressed seems to make more sense anyways for detecting if a key is pressed or not. ","closed_by":{"login":"pcvonz","id":6378569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzg1Njk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6378569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz","html_url":"https://github.com/pcvonz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcvonz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101131/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101131/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}